cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this software or its datasets helped your research or teaching, please
  cite it as below.
type: software
title: "IELTS-API: A free and open IELTS study API"
authors:
  - name: johnlikescarrot
    website: "https://github.com/johnlikescarrot"
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnlikescarrot/IELTS-API"
url: "https://github.com/johnlikescarrot/IELTS-API"
abstract: >-
  A free, open, no-authentication IELTS study API written in TypeScript.
  It serves band-scored academic vocabulary, original academic reading and
  listening practice tests with worked explanations, IELTS writing tasks
  with model answers, a bank of common writing mistakes, a speaking
  question bank with cue cards and sample responses, indicative band-score
  conversion tables, and per-skill exam tips. The implementation is fully
  tested (100% line, branch, and function coverage) and requires no API
  keys, accounts, or payment.
keywords:
  - IELTS
  - API
  - TypeScript
  - REST
  - education
  - vocabulary
  - ESL
  - open-data
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-04"
